    <description>Mindbody quote approval (CFG-16, PRC-18): Sales Manager when a plan discount is over its auto-approve limit (Starter 10%, Accelerate 20%, Ultimate 25%); Deal Desk for Enterprise; VP Sales then Finance when a line is below its floor price (promotion discounts excluded); Finance for payment terms other than Net 30. Smart Approvals and Agentforce approval email as in the sample.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>rejectedQuote</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(
CONTAINS({!Manager_Approver.Outputs.approvalDecision}, &quot;Reject&quot;),
CONTAINS({!Deal_Desk_Approver.Outputs.approvalDecision}, &quot;Reject&quot;),
CONTAINS({!VP_Sales_Approver.Outputs.approvalDecision}, &quot;Reject&quot;),
CONTAINS({!Finance_Floor_Approver.Outputs.approvalDecision}, &quot;Reject&quot;),
CONTAINS({!Payment_Terms.Outputs.approvalDecision}, &quot;Reject&quot;)
)</expression>
    </formulas>
